  "contentHtml": "\n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p><a href=\"/tag/jamshedpur\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Jamshedpur</a>: Diagnostic chain, <a href=\"/tag/thyrocare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Thyrocare</a> has partnered with <a href=\"/tag/secondmedic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SecondMedic</a> to launch it new diagnostic laboratory in Jamshedpur.The new facility is equipped for routine as well as specialised diagnostic testing requirements with trained professionals.Thyrocare said the collaboration with SecondMedic and expansion is in alignment with its focus in strengthening its presence beyond the key metropolitan markets, thereby leading to a more accessible and extensive diagnostic network.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p><a href=\"/tag/rajdeep+panwar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Rajdeep Panwar</a>, Chief Commercial Officer, Thyrocare, said, “Jamshedpur serves as an important market for us as we continue to expand our reach across eastern India. The introduction of our new laboratory, in collaboration with SecondMedic in Jamshedpur, will help us in strengthening our local diagnostic capabilities while maintaining the turnaround and quality standards associated with Thyrocare.”</p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                    